state.description:
`payable` while the hold is live and the fee unpaid; `paid` once a
booking fee has succeeded; `expired` when the hold lapsed unpaid;
`closed` for anything else (cancelled, or nothing to pay).

StudioMe.description:
Everything the studio's banners need (R7.4), in one read:

- pending approval: `photographer.status` `pending`; `submittedAt` null is
  "finish your setup", set is "waiting for review";
- suspended: `status` `suspended`, with `suspensionReason`;
- trial ending: `subscription.status` `trialing` and `endingSoon`;
- past due: `subscription.status` `past_due`, until `graceEndsAt`.
